Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.74,0:01:02.24,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.29,0:01:04.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(418,454)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.75,0:01:04.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是要配海草薯条吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.75,0:01:04.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And did you want kelp fries with that?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.64,0:01:11.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  来订单了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.64,0:01:11.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, order
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.62,0:01:16.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份双层蟹黄堡  加全套配料
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.62,0:01:16.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One double Krabby Patty, everything on it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.56,0:01:17.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份海草薯条
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:17.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One order of kelp fries
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.64,0:01:17.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一份
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.64,0:01:17.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.93,0:01:29.61,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(400,390)}此处点餐
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.27,0:01:21.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  要多大号的海草薯条
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:21.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, what size kelp fries are these?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.97,0:01:25.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,中号
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.97,0:01:25.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Medium
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.60,0:01:26.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上就来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:26.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Coming right up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.61,0:01:30.44,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(712,766)}面包
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.54,0:01:53.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这才叫快餐嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:53.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call fast food
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.22,0:01:57.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  刚刚那是在乱搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.22,0:01:57.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, what's all the hubbarub?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.70,0:02:00.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  刚刚那是在乱搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:00.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, what's all the hubbarub?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.37,0:02:02.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不确定  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.37,0:02:02.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.84,0:02:04.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我本来在给客人上菜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.84,0:02:04.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was bringing the customer's order
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.33,0:02:06.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,突然滑倒  摔进了这滩油污里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:06.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and then I slipped and fell in this grease slick
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.84,0:02:08.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,估计我伤得可重了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:08.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I may be hurt real bad
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.60,0:02:09.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,油污是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:09.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Grease slick, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.95,0:02:13.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.95,0:02:13.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.95,0:02:17.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的小子  那是个隔油池
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.95,0:02:17.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That, me boy, is a grease trap
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.60,0:02:20.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,貌似好一阵子都没人清理隔油池了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It kind of looks like nobody's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:20.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,cleaned out the trap in a while
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.28,0:02:22.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:22.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, SpongeBob, you're right
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.25,0:02:24.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过那可是项大工程
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:24.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But that's a big job
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.49,0:02:27.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只有两个自告奋勇的员工
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:27.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a job that only two volunteer employees
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.80,0:02:30.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要求加薪才能做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.80,0:02:30.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,could do for no extra pay
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.20,0:02:34.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.20,0:02:34.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.09,0:02:37.97,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(390,428)}油罐船租赁
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.62,0:02:39.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没出油
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.62,0:02:39.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing's coming out
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.80,0:02:40.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  我能看下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:40.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, may I see that?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.11,0:02:42.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我先前在电影里看过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:42.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Saw this in a movie once
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.00,0:02:52.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该是我操作方式不对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:52.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe I wasn't doing it right
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.34,0:02:55.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.34,0:02:55.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never mind
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.05,0:02:55.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,方式没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:55.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.20,0:03:02.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吸油吸了一个晚上最适合
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.20,0:03:02.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nothing like a long night of siphoning grease
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.08,0:03:04.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,增进男子汉气概了  对吧蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:04.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to put some hairs on your chest, eh, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.24,0:03:04.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:04.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.53,0:03:07.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然隔油池都清理干净了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.53,0:03:07.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, now that we got the old grease trap cleaned out
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.05,0:03:08.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你觉得这多出来的油应该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:07.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what do you think we should do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.87,0:03:08.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with all this excess grease?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.62,0:03:12.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就这后面
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:12.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right behind there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.54,0:03:15.42,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1080,750)}倾倒
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.80,0:03:20.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  我们快撤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:20.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.34,0:03:24.68,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(748,776)}海之霸
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.68,0:03:27.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  你确定这样合法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:27.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, are you sure that was legal?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.60,0:03:28.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,合法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:28.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Legal"?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.85,0:03:29.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  合法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.85,0:03:29.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, legal
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:35.19,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(744,432)}禁止入内
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.19,0:03:39.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:39.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.94,0:03:42.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这滩雨水也太怪异了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.94,0:03:42.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is the most bizarre precipitation
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.34,0:03:44.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从来没踩上这么怪的水滑倒过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:44.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have ever slipped and fallen in
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.29,0:03:46.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,臭死了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:46.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It reeks
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.67,0:03:50.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过还挺好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.67,0:03:50.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But it tastes delicious
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.43,0:03:53.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的  差点就想到了个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.43,0:03:53.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Darn it, I almost had an idea
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.43,0:03:55.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还真有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.43,0:03:55.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.32,0:03:56.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我真想到了个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:56.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do have an idea
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.33,0:03:59.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:03:59.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.37,0:04:00.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来了  老婆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:00.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Coming, dear
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.00,0:04:05.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有件事情非常不对劲  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:05.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Something is terribly wrong, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.55,0:04:08.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都这么久了  你才发现啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.55,0:04:08.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And it's taken you this long to figure that out?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.06,0:04:11.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,痞老板一早上都有客人在排队
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:11.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plankton has had a line of customers all morning
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.31,0:04:12.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.31,0:04:12.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.06,0:04:15.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我要查明白那小坏蛋有什么打算
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:15.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna go find out what that rascal's up to
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.10,0:04:16.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:16.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Scuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.10,0:04:17.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.10,0:04:17.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'Scuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.04,0:04:18.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,借过一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:18.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Coming through
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.52,0:04:20.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:20.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.45,0:04:25.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尝尝痞老板的全新美味海霸堡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.45,0:04:25.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Try Plankton's new delicious chummy patties
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.30,0:04:27.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现已推出可食用的口味
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:27.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,now with edible flavor"?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.48,0:04:32.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,里面肯定是混进了蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.48,0:04:32.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Clearly something crabby is going on here
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.34,0:04:35.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一位海霸客
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:35.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next chum-stomer please
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.96,0:04:41.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哎哟喂  尤金蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:41.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Eugene Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.10,0:04:44.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别婆婆妈妈了  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.10,0:04:44.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Save the formalities for your mother-in-law, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.68,0:04:46.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你偷了我的蟹黄堡秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:46.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You stole me Krabby Patty formula
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.44,0:04:47.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要把它要回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.44,0:04:47.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I want it back
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.78,0:04:49.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉让你失望了  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:49.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.90,0:04:51.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我根本没干这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.90,0:04:51.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I've done no such thing
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.85,0:04:54.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是在用某人给我留下的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.85,0:04:54.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm simply using a gift somebody left me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.34,0:04:56.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,改进我海霸糊的风味
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:56.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to make my chum taste good
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.52,0:04:57.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,礼物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:57.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A gift?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.58,0:05:02.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,简直就像风味仙子亲自来看我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:05:00.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if I had a personal visit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.65,0:05:02.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from the flavor fairy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.40,0:05:04.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,话虽如此  痞老板
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:04.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Be that as it may, Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.15,0:05:06.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但一个巴掌拍不响
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:06.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it takes two to tango
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.84,0:05:07.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:07.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.75,0:05:10.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  停下你手头的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:10.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, stop what you're doing
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.63,0:05:12.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可是蟹老板  我什么事都没干啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.63,0:05:12.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But Mr. Krabs, I'm not doing anything
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.41,0:05:13.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先别管了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:13.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never mind that now
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.36,0:05:14.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我给你指条新方向
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:14.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got some new direction for you
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.78,0:05:15.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从现在起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.78,0:05:15.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, from now on
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.91,0:05:19.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每卖一个蟹黄堡  就煎两片肉饼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.91,0:05:17.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I want you to fry up two patties
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.79,0:05:19.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for every Krabby Patty we sell
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.29,0:05:20.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一片肉饼用来做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:20.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One for the patty itself
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.67,0:05:22.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,第二片肉饼用来出油
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:22.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and the second just for the grease
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再把这第二片肉饼的油
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Then slather the grease from the second patty
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.70,0:05:28.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,涂到第一个的上面  看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:28.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,onto the first one, and voila
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.66,0:05:33.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,风味豪华蟹黄堡大功告成
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:33.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a deluxe Krabby Patty with extra flavor
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.05,0:05:34.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  你觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.05,0:05:34.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, do you think
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.71,0:05:38.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给人吃油会不会不太健康啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.71,0:05:36.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it might be kind of unhealthy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.35,0:05:38.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to be feeding people all this grease?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.23,0:05:39.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不太健康
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:39.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Unhealthy?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.65,0:05:41.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子  就没人教过你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.65,0:05:41.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy, didn't anyone ever tell you?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.48,0:05:42.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,教过我什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:42.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell me what?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.15,0:05:47.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爱提问对你是危险  对他人是负担
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:47.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Questions are a danger to you and a burden to others
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.76,0:05:49.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,低一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.76,0:05:49.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Little lower
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.10,0:05:50.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再低
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:50.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Little more
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.18,0:05:52.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再低一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.18,0:05:52.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,More, little more
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.23,0:05:54.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  稍微往左一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.23,0:05:54.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, a little to the left now
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.25,0:05:55.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,高一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.25,0:05:55.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Up a bit
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.45,0:05:56.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  等下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:56.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.08,0:05:56.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,高过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:56.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that's too far
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.16,0:05:58.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了好了  完美
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:05:58.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.09,0:05:58.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这边就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.09,0:05:58.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right there
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.92,0:06:01.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  希望不管你在喊什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:01.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, I hope whatever you're yelling about
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.70,0:06:04.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都比我上午的盹还重要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:04.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is something more important than my mid-morning nap
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.90,0:06:07.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是在挂新的广告牌而已  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:07.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just hanging a new sign, Squidward
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.59,0:06:09.55,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(936,420)}现在供应\N豪华蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.87,0:06:09.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,豪华蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.87,0:06:09.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Deluxe Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.55,0:06:11.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,简直全世界都需要这玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:11.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just what the world needed
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.80,0:06:14.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  高一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:14.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, a little higher now
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.85,0:06:15.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:15.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at that
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.43,0:06:16.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.43,0:06:16.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.22,0:06:17.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那边  就在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:17.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There, right up there
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.42,0:06:17.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:17.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.88,0:06:19.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我什么都没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:19.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.12,0:06:20.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,往右边一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:20.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A little to the right
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.83,0:06:22.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:22.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, I see it
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.02,0:06:24.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王挂了个新广告牌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:24.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a new sign up at the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.90,0:06:26.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上面写他们正在供应
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:26.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It says they're serving
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.32,0:06:29.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一种叫做豪华蟹黄堡的玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:29.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,something called a deluxe Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.72,0:06:31.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听着就好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:31.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That sounds delicious
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.45,0:06:32.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那倒是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:32.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're telling me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.50,0:06:33.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要尝一个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.50,0:06:33.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna try one
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.79,0:06:38.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一位排队的海霸客
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.79,0:06:38.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Next chum-stomer in line, please
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.52,0:06:40.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:40.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.15,0:06:45.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这些可真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:45.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,These are delicious
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.28,0:06:46.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.28,0:06:46.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.03,0:06:48.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都想象不到加了什么料能这么好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:48.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine what makes them taste so good
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.39,0:06:51.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊好啊好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:51.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.62,0:06:53.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下可算是明白了蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:53.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I actually do see what Krabs meant
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.90,0:06:55.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说的一个巴掌拍不响啥意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:55.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,when he said two can play that game
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.76,0:06:58.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奈何他比自己想象的还要傻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:58.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But he's a bigger fool than he realizes
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.10,0:07:01.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会以为痞老板会这么坐以待毙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.10,0:06:59.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if he thinks ol' Plankton
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:01.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is gonna take this one lying down
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.15,0:07:06.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  我好撑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.15,0:07:06.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Man, am I stuffed
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.52,0:07:07.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:07.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.42,0:07:10.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过那个豪华蟹黄堡可好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:10.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But that deluxe Krabby Patty was so swimming good
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.62,0:07:12.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搞得我都要再来一份
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:12.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get another one
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.05,0:07:13.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听上去不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.05,0:07:13.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a plan
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.37,0:07:14.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:14.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.21,0:07:15.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个牌子上写什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:15.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's that sign say?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.46,0:07:16.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上面好像写着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:16.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It looks like it says
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.42,0:07:18.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全新超级海霸堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:18.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,New Ultra chummy patties
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.26,0:07:20.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,充满四倍香烤美味
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.26,0:07:20.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,packed with quadruple grilled goodness"
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.23,0:07:28.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,四倍美味吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:28.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quadruple goodness?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.05,0:07:29.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走着瞧好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.05,0:07:29.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.63,0:07:32.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,烤架继续烤  不要停
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:32.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep the grill going nonstop
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.50,0:07:34.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快点出油  出得越多越好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:34.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to crank out as much grease as possible
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.39,0:07:35.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好的  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.39,0:07:35.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, okay, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.85,0:07:36.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会关烤架的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:36.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I never turn the grill off
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.87,0:07:38.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果你想要  我还能比不关还不关
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:38.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I can turn it off even less than that, if you want
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.57,0:07:41.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不是很明白
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:41.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't really see what--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.48,0:07:43.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的老天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:43.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mermaid's mollusk
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.61,0:07:47.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:47.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What in the name of Neptune is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.05,0:07:49.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:49.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.10,0:07:50.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不小心把几块面包
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.10,0:07:50.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I accidentally dropped some buns
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.35,0:07:51.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,掉进装剩油的油罐里了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.35,0:07:51.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,into our vat of extra grease
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.87,0:07:53.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,已经泡在里面差不多一小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:53.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, they've been soaking in there for about an hour
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.57,0:07:58.33,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(684,288)}全新美味面包\N每个面包\N都有陈酿一个多小时的风味
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.33,0:08:00.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美味面包  是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:00.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yummy bunz, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.30,0:08:03.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你可得再努力点了  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:01.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you're gonna have to try
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:03.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a little harder than that, Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.33,0:08:07.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,饥饿的大众就快听说我有最新创造了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.33,0:08:07.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,once the hungry public hears about my newest creation
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.15,0:08:07.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,创造吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:07.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Creation?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.97,0:08:09.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的扫描仪显示
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:09.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My scanner shows
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.20,0:08:11.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那最多就只是个烧焦的油渣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:11.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that's nothing more than a burned grease crumb
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.47,0:08:12.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:12.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're right
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.42,0:08:14.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且还风味满满呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.42,0:08:14.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And it's packed with flavor
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:17.18,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,216)}全新香脆油渣\N满满风味的油炸油渣
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.59,0:08:17.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,香脆油渣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:17.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Crispity crunchities?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.37,0:08:24.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恶心死了  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.37,0:08:24.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Peeyew, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.49,0:08:28.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你平常都不把那坨冲进马桶里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.49,0:08:28.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you usually flush that stuff down the toilet?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.23,0:08:30.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是我们最新的产品
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:30.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is our latest product
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.67,0:08:34.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是装在纸盘上的纯油
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.67,0:08:34.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's pure grease on a paper plate
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.72,0:08:36.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好诚实  真是精神可嘉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.72,0:08:36.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll give you points for honesty
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:39.79,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(772,242)}全新哇哦汤\N蟹堡王独家
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.87,0:08:43.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  把那七份哇哦汤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.87,0:08:43.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, get those seven orders of wow! soup
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.17,0:08:44.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,送去三号桌  马上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.17,0:08:44.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,out to table three pronto
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.65,0:08:46.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,必须让客人一直开心下去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.65,0:08:46.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We got to keep these customers happy
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.17,0:08:47.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然痞老板会把他们偷回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.17,0:08:47.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or Plankton will steal them back
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.05,0:08:58.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你吃不吃这玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.05,0:08:58.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you going to eat that?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.63,0:09:00.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是应该送到三号桌的餐点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:09:00.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was supposed to be going to table three
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.57,0:09:01.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.57,0:09:01.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.05,0:09:03.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.05,0:09:03.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.14,0:09:05.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.14,0:09:05.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.06,0:09:06.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这是要把汤送去三号桌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:06.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna serve that soup to table three
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.78,0:09:08.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是要等着它起来自己走过去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.78,0:09:07.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or are you gonna wait
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.35,0:09:08.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,till it gets up and walks there itself?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.73,0:09:09.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说实在的  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:09.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.97,0:09:10.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一直在想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.97,0:09:10.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.31,0:09:13.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个  你不觉得也许这卖油的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.31,0:09:13.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And, well, don't you think maybe this whole grease thing
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.80,0:09:15.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有一点点过头了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:15.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,has gone a bit too far?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.34,0:09:18.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你知道我在想什么吗  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:18.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know what I think, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.15,0:09:21.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想你应该想着别再想了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.15,0:09:21.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think you should be thinking about not thinking
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.01,0:09:22.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回去工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.01,0:09:22.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and get back to work
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.80,0:09:28.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要吃香脆油渣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.80,0:09:28.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Got to have crunchity munchity
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.07,0:09:29.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:29.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.96,0:09:30.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:30.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.07,0:09:32.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连我最好的朋友也沦陷了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:32.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not my best friend too
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:39.43,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1128,650)}裤头村卫生局
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.77,0:09:46.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:46.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.55,0:09:47.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有谁叫了卫生检查员过来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.55,0:09:47.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did somebody call the health inspector?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.33,0:09:49.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:49.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.27,0:09:51.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有谁叫了卫生检查员过来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.27,0:09:51.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did somebody call the health inspector?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.58,0:09:55.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有谁叫了卫生检查员过来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:55.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did somebody call a health inspector?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.17,0:09:55.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:55.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was me, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.32,0:09:58.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是想跟你说  就是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:58.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to tell you that, well
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.48,0:10:01.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,过去两周痞老板跟蟹老板一直
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:01.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the past two weeks Plankton and Mr. Krabs have been--
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.39,0:10:03.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一直在给别人吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:03.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,they've been feeding people--
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.62,0:10:05.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一直在给别人吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:05.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They've been feeding people--
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.87,0:10:07.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一直在给别人吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:07.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,they've been feeding people--
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.72,0:10:09.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.72,0:10:09.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.07,0:10:12.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事  检查员先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.07,0:10:12.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing, Mr. Inspector
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.52,0:10:13.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们一直在给别人吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.52,0:10:13.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They've been feeding people--
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.33,0:10:18.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是友善的竞争嘛  两边都是老
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.33,0:10:18.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just a friendly competition between old
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.18,0:10:20.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,朋朋朋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:20.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,F-f-f
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.06,0:10:22.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,朋朋朋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:22.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,F-f-f--
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.69,0:10:23.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:23.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,friends?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.27,0:10:23.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,朋友  没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.27,0:10:23.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Friends, right
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.48,0:10:29.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们在给别人吃油
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:29.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're feeding people grease
Dialogue: 1,0:10:29.85,0:10:34.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怪不得我会认得这股臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.85,0:10:34.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I thought I recognized this horrible stench
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,本来我还以为是你们俩哪一个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I thought maybe one of you two
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.32,0:10:37.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一段时间没洗澡了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:37.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,hadn't showered in a while
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.46,0:10:39.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,检查员  检查员
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.46,0:10:39.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Officer, officer
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.79,0:10:42.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要陈述一个事实  请你记录在案
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:42.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would just like to state for the record
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.23,0:10:45.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这都是他出的主意  全都是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.23,0:10:45.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that this was all his idea, all of it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.79,0:10:46.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:46.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.51,0:10:48.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样的话  告诉你们个好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.51,0:10:48.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, you'll be happy to know
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.97,0:10:51.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会勒令你们两家餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.97,0:10:51.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be ordering both your restaurants
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.28,0:10:52.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全部停业
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:52.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to be closed down
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.45,0:10:55.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,直到你们俩混球收拾干净检点自己
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.45,0:10:55.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,until the two of you slimeballs can clean up your act
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.78,0:10:57.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:57.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good day
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.15,0:11:03.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我去洗澡了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.15,0:11:03.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm taking a bath
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.10,0:11:05.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来就这样了  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:05.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess this is it, boy:
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.00,0:11:06.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一个时代结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.00,0:11:06.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The end of an era
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.35,0:11:08.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还没结束  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.35,0:11:08.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, it's not the end, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.70,0:11:11.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,结束了  除非我能找到办法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.70,0:11:11.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It is, unless I can find a way
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.26,0:11:13.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把这么多油吸收干净
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.26,0:11:13.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to get this grease soaked up
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.34,0:11:14.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.34,0:11:14.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.05,0:11:16.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚才说吸收吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:16.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you say soaked up?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.98,0:11:18.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有什么区别
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:18.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What difference does it make?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.67,0:11:19.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:19.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll see
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.62,0:11:29.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚原来是场梦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.62,0:11:29.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It was all a dream
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.78,0:11:31.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是梦  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:31.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.37,0:11:34.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我把周围的脏东西全吸收了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.37,0:11:33.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I soaked up all the offending substances
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:34.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from the surrounding area
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.95,0:11:37.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得去妥善处理一下了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.95,0:11:37.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I'm gonna go dispose of them properly
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.40,0:11:39.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王不会再有油了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.40,0:11:39.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krusty Krab is grease free
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.26,0:11:42.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  不要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:42.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, no
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.18,0:11:46.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,香脆油渣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:46.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Crunchity munchities
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.10,0:11:46.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,住嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:46.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.06,0:11:47.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,住嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:47.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stop it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.65,0:11:48.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走开
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.65,0:11:48.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go away
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.34,0:11:50.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.34,0:11:50.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.73,0:11:55.23,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,海绵名模
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:57.73,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(237.33,454)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:57.73,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:12:00.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:12:00.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(393.575,408)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:12:00.15,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(513.742,662)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:02.78,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:02.78,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.82,0:12:04.28,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(406,458)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.07,0:12:05.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你微不足道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.07,0:12:05.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.87,0:12:08.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这点尘垢是想要吓唬我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:08.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is all that grime meant to scare me
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.65,0:12:10.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,镜子先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.65,0:12:10.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Mirror?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.02,0:12:13.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我见过比你更强壮的沙丁鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.02,0:12:13.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've met sardines tougher than you are
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.32,0:12:16.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该让你认清自己几斤几两了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.32,0:12:16.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Time to put you in your place
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.50,0:12:25.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真好看  镜子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:25.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looking good, mirror
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.77,0:12:27.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉刚刚朝你放狠话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:27.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry about the harsh words
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.72,0:12:29.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在该来对付地板了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:29.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now to attack these floors
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.02,0:12:32.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.02,0:12:32.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.16,0:12:34.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那家伙在蟹堡王简直是个宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:33.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's an absolutely treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:34.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to have around the restaurant
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.31,0:12:38.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听起来蟹老板又在向合伙人吹我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.31,0:12:37.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sounds like Mr. Krabs is bragging about me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.27,0:12:38.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,again to his associates
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.50,0:12:41.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到现在也陪着我很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:41.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And he's been with me for such a long time now
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.62,0:12:42.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:42.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.57,0:12:46.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是恐怕我今天得放小家伙走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.57,0:12:44.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.03,0:12:46.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,have to let the little guy go today
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.00,0:12:47.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  他得
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.00,0:12:47.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yep, he's gonna have to--
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.10,0:12:48.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.10,0:12:48.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.00,0:12:49.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放小家伙走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:49.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Let the little guy go"?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.40,0:12:50.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小家伙  小家伙是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.40,0:12:50.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Little guy, who's the little guy?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.55,0:12:52.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要么是我  要么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.55,0:12:52.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It must be either me or--
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.75,0:12:55.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.75,0:12:55.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.12,0:12:58.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我比较高
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.12,0:12:58.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am taller
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.00,0:13:00.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就是小家伙  章鱼儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:13:00.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're the little guy, squidsy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.03,0:13:00.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.03,0:13:00.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.87,0:13:02.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且不准你再叫我章鱼儿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.87,0:13:02.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I want you to stop calling me squidsy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.61,0:13:05.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥一时间看着更高了点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:05.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward looked taller there for a second
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.31,0:13:06.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好再量得准一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.31,0:13:06.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Better get a more accurate measurement
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.55,0:13:09.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这是想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:09.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.26,0:13:12.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是量量看我们哪个才是小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.26,0:13:12.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just seeing which one of us is the little guy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.98,0:13:15.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看样子就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.98,0:13:15.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And it looks like it is you
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.39,0:13:16.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:16.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.85,0:13:18.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.85,0:13:18.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.04,0:13:21.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还没量我把腿完全伸长的身高呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.04,0:13:21.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We haven't measured with my legs at full extension yet
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.11,0:13:22.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不管
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:22.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't care
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.36,0:13:23.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回厨房里去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:23.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now get back in the kitchen
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.36,0:13:26.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等你发现小家伙会出什么事就会管了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.36,0:13:24.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll care when you find out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.44,0:13:26.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,what's gonna happen to the little guy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.55,0:13:29.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我骗谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:29.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who am I kidding?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.67,0:13:31.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我得面对事实
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:31.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need to face the facts
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.68,0:13:33.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,面对我就是小家伙的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:33.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,face the fact that I'm the little guy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.96,0:13:36.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,面对蟹老板要放我走的事实
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:36.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and that Mr. Krabs is letting me go today
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.79,0:13:38.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老螃蟹今天要放你走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.79,0:13:38.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabs is letting you go today?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.34,0:13:43.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也就是说  你再也不是我同事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:43.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As in, I won't have to work with you ever again?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.18,0:13:48.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:48.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good-bye, Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:13:49.07,0:13:50.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见  我熟悉的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.07,0:13:50.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good-bye, life as I know it
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.51,0:13:55.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  虽然我不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.51,0:13:55.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, as much as I don't like doing it
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.80,0:13:57.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但我还是得放它走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.80,0:13:57.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have to let him go
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.60,0:13:59.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它长太大  笼子关不下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:59.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotten too big for his cage
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.95,0:14:02.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,飞吧  小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.95,0:14:02.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go on, little guy
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.34,0:14:03.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,飞走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:03.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fly away
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.45,0:14:04.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会想你的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.45,0:14:04.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll be missed
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.35,0:14:16.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又有什么用  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.35,0:14:16.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's the use, Gary?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.37,0:14:19.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我失去了生活的热情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:19.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've lost the will to go on
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.20,0:14:22.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不想再继续下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.20,0:14:22.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like going on
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.79,0:14:27.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗨  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:27.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hi, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.92,0:14:31.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰你自怨自艾  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:28.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.93,0:14:31.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,your fit of self-loathing, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.51,0:14:33.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我又来找你借冰箱了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:33.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just borrowing your refrigerator again
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.97,0:14:35.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你家冰箱怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.97,0:14:35.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened to yours?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.06,0:14:35.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.06,0:14:35.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.03,0:14:36.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是空了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.03,0:14:36.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just empty
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.50,0:14:39.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拿走它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:39.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get it out of my sight
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.25,0:14:42.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我既然现在没法给自己买吃的了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:42.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now that I have no means of purchasing food for myself
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.25,0:14:44.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也就用不上冰箱了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.25,0:14:44.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do not need a refrigerator
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别沮丧  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't get down on yourself, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.70,0:14:48.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是可以给我买吃的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:48.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can still purchase food for me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.92,0:14:50.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不行  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.92,0:14:50.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I can't, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.97,0:14:52.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我今天失业了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.97,0:14:52.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I lost my job today
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.55,0:14:54.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我再也没法买吃的给你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.55,0:14:54.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to buy food for you
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.02,0:14:57.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或者给小蜗  或者给任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:57.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or for Gary or for anybody
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.87,0:14:58.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:14:58.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.75,0:14:59.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:14:59.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.72,0:15:01.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道不知道不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.72,0:15:01.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know, I don't know, I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.72,0:15:04.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我做了这么久的煎炸厨师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.72,0:15:04.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been a fry cook for so long
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.49,0:15:06.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别的估计一个都不会做
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.49,0:15:06.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can do anything else
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.91,0:15:07.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.91,0:15:07.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.30,0:15:11.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做我找工作的时候会做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:11.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just do what I do when I'm looking for a job
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.67,0:15:12.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,躺平放松
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.67,0:15:12.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Kick back
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.47,0:15:15.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看电视  灌下一盒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:15.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch some TV, and chug down a carton
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.81,0:15:17.56,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,364)}液态香肠饮料
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.81,0:15:17.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,液态香肠饮料
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.81,0:15:17.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of drinkable sausage
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.38,0:15:21.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好办法  小蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.38,0:15:21.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good, Gary
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.69,0:15:24.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,招聘广告里面一定有工作机会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:24.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There have to be some job openings in the classifieds
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.77,0:15:29.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过这些广告闻着有点过期了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.77,0:15:29.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Although these ads smell a little out of date
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.88,0:15:31.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好找点新鲜的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.88,0:15:31.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I better get some fresh ones
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.74,0:15:32.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,律师
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.74,0:15:32.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lawyer
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.47,0:15:33.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行  得经常吵嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:33.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,no, too much arguing
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.76,0:15:36.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,特技车手  我都没驾照
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:36.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stunt driver, don't have a boating license
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.02,0:15:38.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,宇航员  袋装的食物我不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.02,0:15:38.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Astronaut, don't like food in a bag
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.12,0:15:40.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这个听着有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:40.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This one sounds interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:41.25,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(800,234)}招聘银行柜员
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.00,0:15:41.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,招聘银行柜员
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:41.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Bank teller needed"
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.25,0:15:43.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟煎炸厨师工作应该差不了多少
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:43.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That shouldn't be too much of a stretch from fry cooking
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.75,0:15:44.88,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1090,444)}海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.43,0:15:45.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,20  40
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:45.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,20, 40
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.99,0:15:46.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,60  80
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.99,0:15:46.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,60, 80
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.65,0:15:46.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,90
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.65,0:15:46.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,90
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.92,0:15:47.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,95  96
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.92,0:15:47.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,95, 96
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.59,0:15:48.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,97
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:48.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,97
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.72,0:15:52.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:52.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order up
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.15,0:16:04.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:04.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think, boss?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.31,0:16:06.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.31,0:16:06.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Clamshells
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.06,0:16:07.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你干了什么好事  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.06,0:16:07.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What have you done, boy?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.36,0:16:10.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我叫你给我盖的是座房子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:10.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I told you to build me a house
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.42,0:16:11.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不是个三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.42,0:16:11.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not a sandwich
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.45,0:16:16.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我也做不了木工  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.45,0:16:16.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm not a carpenter, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.90,0:16:20.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要新鲜地重新来过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:20.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I need to start fresh
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.70,0:16:20.50,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1138,428)}新鲜
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.31,0:16:23.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找份感觉很自然的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:23.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with a job that feels natural
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:24.42,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1032,542)}自然
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.69,0:16:28.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还得说明  这是份适合海绵的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:28.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,something that says, "this is a job for a sponge"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:28.38,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(690,146)}这是份适合海绵的工作
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.85,0:16:31.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道哪能找到那样的工作吗  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:31.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Any idea where I can find a job like that, Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.02,0:16:31.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:31.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.97,0:16:33.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:33.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But yes
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.65,0:16:34.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太明显了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.65,0:16:34.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's so obvious
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.63,0:16:36.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你应该去蟹堡王工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.63,0:16:36.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You should work at the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.55,0:16:37.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那边需要煎炸厨师
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.55,0:16:37.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They need a fry cook
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.80,0:16:38.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.80,0:16:38.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.91,0:16:40.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,之前干那份工作被开除了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:40.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's the job I got fired from
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.31,0:16:40.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:40.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.52,0:16:46.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你多半应该跟你身后那位海绵谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.52,0:16:46.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mayhaps you should talk to the sponge behind you
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.25,0:16:47.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他看着挺开心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.25,0:16:47.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He looks happy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.35,0:16:48.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那只是块广告牌  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.35,0:16:48.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's just a billboard, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.07,0:16:51.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不你去应聘广告牌的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:51.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get a job as a billboard?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没法肉身成广告牌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's physically possible
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.23,0:16:57.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过我可以去试镜  做个海绵名模
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.23,0:16:57.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I could audition to be a sponge model
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.12,0:16:59.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  随你的便
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:16:59.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine, do it your way
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.75,0:17:05.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,布景好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:05.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What a setup
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.61,0:17:07.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好吧  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:07.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.09,0:17:08.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许就不该来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.09,0:17:08.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe this was a mistake
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.17,0:17:11.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许我根本就没才能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.17,0:17:11.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't have the talent
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.50,0:17:16.09,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(538,148)}试镜
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.69,0:17:13.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你胸怀才能没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.69,0:17:13.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You have the talent
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.21,0:17:16.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但你有天分吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.21,0:17:16.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But do you have the natural ability?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.10,0:17:16.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有  可是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:16.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.93,0:17:18.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下  那俩不是一回事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:18.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't that the same thing?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.30,0:17:19.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,进去试试就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:19.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you find out?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.74,0:17:20.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:20.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.68,0:17:22.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我做不到  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:22.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't do this, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.24,0:17:23.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万一我比不过竞争对手怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:23.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What if I don't stack up to the competition?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.05,0:17:26.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许我该求蟹老板让我复职
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.05,0:17:26.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should just beg Mr. Krabs for my old job back
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.65,0:17:27.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.65,0:17:27.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No way
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.47,0:17:29.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在那样太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.47,0:17:29.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's too late for that now
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.05,0:17:30.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老螃蟹再也不需要你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:30.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabs doesn't need you anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.13,0:17:34.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在正是你的机会  证明你不需要他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:34.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is your chance to prove you don't need him
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.60,0:17:37.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快进去  给我赚点吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:37.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now get in there and earn me some groceries
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:43.12,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1036,774)}试镜
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.84,0:17:41.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我这位朋友想要试镜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.84,0:17:41.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My friend here wants to audition
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.35,0:17:43.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,饰演海绵名模
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.35,0:17:43.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the sponge model role
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.58,0:17:45.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个  说想要就有点过了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:45.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, well, "want" is a strong word
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.92,0:17:47.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有点想试镜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:47.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like an audition
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.15,0:17:48.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但要是选好角就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.15,0:17:48.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but if you've already cast it, that's fine
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.63,0:17:49.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,选好角了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.63,0:17:49.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have you cast it?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.34,0:17:50.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好像选好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.34,0:17:50.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think she's already cast it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.12,0:17:51.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还是走吧  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:51.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We better go, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.04,0:17:51.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:51.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.38,0:17:52.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你想试镜吗  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.38,0:17:52.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want the audition, kid?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.98,0:17:53.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以试
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.98,0:17:53.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.84,0:17:54.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真能吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.84,0:17:54.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I did?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.37,0:17:56.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,展示一下你的才能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.37,0:17:56.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Show me what you got
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.51,0:17:58.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  那来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.51,0:17:58.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, here goes
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.09,0:17:59.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  麻烦你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:17:59.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, please?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.60,0:18:06.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.60,0:18:06.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.79,0:18:14.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.79,0:18:14.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, okay
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.07,0:18:15.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赶紧继续这场车祸现场
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:15.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get on with this train wreck
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.92,0:18:17.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  这就继续
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.92,0:18:17.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, getting on it
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.90,0:18:22.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当你祈求愿望实现
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:22.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When you dream upon a wish
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.25,0:18:24.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就会欣喜地知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.25,0:18:24.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll be heartened to know
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.57,0:18:30.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,希望会装满你的碗盘
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.57,0:18:30.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That hope fills your dish to the brim
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.87,0:18:32.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好  谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.87,0:18:32.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.67,0:18:33.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我听够了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:33.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.72,0:18:34.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我表现咋样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.72,0:18:34.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How'd I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.65,0:18:35.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,烂透了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:35.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Horribly
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.92,0:18:38.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我连比你有才能的蛤蜊都见过
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:38.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've seen clams with more talent than you
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.98,0:18:42.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过既然这角色特地要求一名真海绵
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.98,0:18:40.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But since the role
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.01,0:18:42.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,specifically calls for a real sponge
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.10,0:18:43.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你通过试镜了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:43.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the part is yours
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.26,0:18:45.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是剧本
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.26,0:18:45.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's the script
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.30,0:18:46.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天十点开始拍摄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.30,0:18:46.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We start shooting tomorrow at 10:00
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.98,0:18:47.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:47.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't be late
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来一个海绵也能在这座镇子成功
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess a sponge can make it in this town
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.05,0:18:54.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要成明星了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.05,0:18:54.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am gonna be a star
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.96,0:19:02.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我正站在这里  采访这位电视新星
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.96,0:19:02.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm standing here with the new face of television
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.30,0:19:04.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:04.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. SpongeBob SquarePants
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.28,0:19:06.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我确信观众们会想了解一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:06.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the viewing audience would love to know
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.19,0:19:09.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,成为明日之星是什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:09.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how does it feel to be the next big thing?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.45,0:19:11.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,妙极了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:11.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fantastic
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.20,0:19:14.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.20,0:19:14.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.51,0:19:16.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:16.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.80,0:19:18.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:18.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.21,0:19:20.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.21,0:19:20.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.46,0:19:23.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你刚有说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.46,0:19:23.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob, you say something?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.10,0:19:24.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有啊  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:24.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.18,0:19:26.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我说  你眼前的正是电视新星
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:26.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I said, "you're looking at the new face of television"
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.90,0:19:27.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:27.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.77,0:19:29.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好回家睡个美容觉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:29.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, better go home and get some beauty sleep
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.80,0:19:31.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  美容觉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:31.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, beauty sleep
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.45,0:19:33.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.45,0:19:33.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.45,0:19:35.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你眼前的是一位改头换面的海绵
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.45,0:19:35.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You are looking at a changed sponge
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.44,0:19:36.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过放心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.44,0:19:36.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But don't worry
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.31,0:19:38.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会忘记助我一路高升的大家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.31,0:19:38.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I won't forget all the people who helped me on the way up
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.53,0:19:39.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下午好  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:39.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Afternoon, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.27,0:19:41.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚说到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.27,0:19:41.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just as I was saying
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.30,0:19:43.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感谢你给我这个不起眼的起步机会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:43.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like to thank you for giving me my humble start
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.62,0:19:45.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会忘记你的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:45.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I won't forget you
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.86,0:19:46.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是在说什么玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:46.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.13,0:19:50.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多半又是在胡言乱语  一如往常
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.13,0:19:50.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Probably just nonsense and babbling, as usual
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.07,0:19:53.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你下次见到我的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.07,0:19:53.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, when next you see me
Dialogue: 1,0:19:53.09,0:19:55.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是在电视上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.09,0:19:55.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,it shall be on the television
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.35,0:20:02.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.35,0:20:02.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're back
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.26,0:20:04.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明星的第一天可是明星的关键
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.26,0:20:04.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A star's first day is his most important
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.43,0:20:06.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  我确认下片场有没有准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.43,0:20:06.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great, let me see if they're ready on set
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.30,0:20:07.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝来了  导演
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:07.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob's here, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.07,0:20:08.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.07,0:20:08.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, great
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.65,0:20:10.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  你可以进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.65,0:20:10.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, you can go right in
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.90,0:20:15.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我准备好拍特写镜头了  导演先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:15.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for my close-up, Mr. Director
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.65,0:20:16.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:16.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Very well
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.07,0:20:18.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,脱裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:18.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lose the pants
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.03,0:20:23.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,汉斯  我的明星呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.03,0:20:23.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hans, where's my star?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.36,0:20:28.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.36,0:20:28.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.75,0:20:29.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎怎  怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:29.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wh-wh-what's happening?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.16,0:20:31.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这一幕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:31.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In this scene
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.37,0:20:33.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你得清理卫浴设备
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:33.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you will be cleaning bathroom fixtures
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.87,0:20:34.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.87,0:20:34.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.17,0:20:36.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我的清洁用具呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:36.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So where's my cleaning utensil?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.52,0:20:37.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的老天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.52,0:20:37.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ach, du lieber
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.52,0:20:37.80,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 德语 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.80,0:20:39.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还不懂吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:39.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.25,0:20:41.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你就是清洁用具
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.25,0:20:41.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You are the cleaning utensil
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.46,0:20:43.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开机
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:43.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Roll speed
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.60,0:20:45.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全新海绵广告  第一次拍摄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:45.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,New sponge commercial, take one
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.85,0:20:48.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开拍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:48.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Action
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.18,0:20:49.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:49.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.40,0:20:51.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的卫生间一片狼藉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.40,0:20:51.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your bathroom is a disaster
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.42,0:20:55.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快用全新海绵  迅速清洁干净吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:55.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get it cleaned up fast with the new sponge
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.35,0:21:01.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有了全新海绵  家务小菜一碟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.35,0:21:01.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Household chores are a snap with new sponge
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.73,0:21:03.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以清理水槽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.73,0:21:03.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It cleans sinks
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.54,0:21:08.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看那闪光啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.54,0:21:08.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just look at that shine
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.92,0:21:13.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全新海绵连最顽固的尘垢都能去除
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:11.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,New sponge cuts through
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:13.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,even the toughest grime and grit
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.24,0:21:18.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全新海绵还可以清理淋浴间
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.24,0:21:18.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,New sponge also cleans showers
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.97,0:21:24.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那瓷砖看起来焕然一新
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.97,0:21:24.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That tile looks good as new
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.63,0:21:26.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但最棒的是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:26.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But best of all
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.97,0:21:30.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全新海绵可以把马桶清理得闪闪发亮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.97,0:21:30.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,new sponge can make any toilet sparkle
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.77,0:21:39.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.77,0:21:39.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.32,0:21:43.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.32,0:21:43.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't do this
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.02,0:21:45.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:45.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cut
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.70,0:21:46.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.70,0:21:46.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.10,0:21:49.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己不适合演戏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.10,0:21:49.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm cut out for acting
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.27,0:21:50.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.27,0:21:50.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Was?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.27,0:21:50.07,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 德语 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.07,0:21:52.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你明明说过自己是专业演员
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.07,0:21:52.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You said you are professional actor
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.27,0:21:53.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我并不是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.27,0:21:53.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.12,0:21:56.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是个煎炸厨师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.12,0:21:56.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am a fry cook
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.99,0:21:58.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那才是我的本职
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.99,0:21:58.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's what I am
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.52,0:22:00.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我向来都只是个煎炸厨师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.52,0:22:00.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and that's what I've always been
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.34,0:22:02.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉浪费了你的时间  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.34,0:22:02.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to waste your time, mister
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.67,0:22:04.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别走  别走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.67,0:22:04.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.53,0:22:09.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,轻轻地放
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.53,0:22:09.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ever so gently
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.22,0:22:11.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.22,0:22:11.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.19,0:22:16.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你让我复职吧  求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.19,0:22:16.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please take me back, please
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.14,0:22:19.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我保证会表现得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.14,0:22:19.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll do better
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.16,0:22:20.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.16,0:22:20.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.73,0:22:23.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小子  你这是在说什么玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.73,0:22:23.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy, what are you going on about?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.46,0:22:25.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我听见你打电话说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.46,0:22:25.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I heard you on the phone saying
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.73,0:22:27.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要放小家伙走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.73,0:22:27.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you're gonna let the little guy go
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.02,0:22:29.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可我不想走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.02,0:22:29.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to go
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.47,0:22:30.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你别放我走  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.47,0:22:30.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please don't let me go, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.51,0:22:34.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你眼前这个小家伙可不想走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.51,0:22:34.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're looking at a little guy that doesn't want to go
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.41,0:22:35.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.41,0:22:35.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.55,0:22:36.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不会赶你走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.55,0:22:36.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I won't get rid of you
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.82,0:22:38.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是有个条件
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.82,0:22:38.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on one condition
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.18,0:22:42.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.18,0:22:42.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.66,0:22:44.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就是全世界最棒的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.66,0:22:44.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is the best job in the world
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.21,0:22:46.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能小点声
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.21,0:22:46.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you keep it down in there?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.68,0:22:48.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还要专心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.68,0:22:48.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to concentrate
